---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageShare from '../components/PageShare.astro';
import ExternalCtaIcon from '../components/ExternalCtaIcon.astro';
---
<Base jsonLd={{ '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'ProfilePage', mainEntity: { '@type': 'Person', '@id': new URL('/about/#person', Astro.site).toString(), name: 'Murtaza Saeed', url: new URL('/about/', Astro.site).toString(), sameAs: ['https://linkedin.com/in/murtaza-saeed'] } }} title="About Murtaza | Remote Business Advisor" description="Murtaza Saeed, Remote Business Advisor: business performance reviews, business analysis and strategy, information systems and process improvement." image="/images/murtaza-saeed-profile-web.jpg" imageAlt="Portrait of Murtaza Saeed, Remote Business Advisor">
<section class="page-head wrap"><h1>About Murtaza</h1><h2>Remote Business Advisor</h2></section>
<section class="section wrap content-page about-page"><figure class="about-portrait"><img src="/images/murtaza-saeed-profile-web.jpg" alt="Portrait of Murtaza Saeed" width="520" height="520" /><figcaption>Murtaza Saeed<br /><span>Remote Business Advisor</span></figcaption></figure><div class="prose">
<p>I started as an accountant at E.A. Match and went on to become General Manager, responsible for three manufacturing units, a trading operation and a workshop profit centre. Later, as Chief Finance Manager at Pwani Oil Products, I developed management reports for the Board and department heads.</p>
<p>I now work as a Remote Business Advisor. I take on selected assignments for owners, managing directors and CEOs of established mid-sized businesses, especially owner-managed and family firms in manufacturing, processing, FMCG, distribution and trading. I work remotely from Kenya, mainly with businesses in Kenya and East Africa, and also take on selected assignments in the UK and other markets. <a href="/work-with-me/">Work With Me</a></p>
<p>I publish independent business analysis on <em>Murtaza Insights</em>. The articles also give prospective clients a sense of how I approach business problems. <a href="/insights/">Read Insights</a></p>
<p>Golf occasionally finds its way into Biz Buzz. Retirement, fortunately, provides time for extensive fieldwork. <a href="/the-lighter-side/">Browse Biz Buzz</a></p>
<div class="page-end-actions">
<p><a class="button" href="https://linkedin.com/in/murtaza-saeed" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><ExternalCtaIcon network="linkedin" />View LinkedIn Profile</a></p>
<p><a class="button" href="/in-depth-profile">Read In-Depth Profile</a></p>
</div>
<PageShare label="Share This Page" title="About Murtaza" />
</div></section>
</Base>

